    <contentBlocks>
      <Value Culture="en-US"><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a7010006-aaaa-4bbb-8ccc-000000000001",
      "key": "a7010006-5555-4555-8555-111100000003",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "html",
          "culture": "en-US",
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "\u003C!--\n  CENTRO 57357 FULL DYNAMIC BLOG BODY\n\n  WORDPRESS PLACEMENT\n  1. Keep the existing page title, featured image, category, date and sidebar.\n  2. Remove the current article body beginning with the introductory paragraph\n     and ending with the current \u201CAbout Centro\u201D section.\n  3. Add one WordPress \u201CCustom HTML\u201D block and paste this entire file.\n\n  The component uses CSS and native HTML only. No JavaScript is required.\n--\u003E\n\n\u003Cstyle\u003E\n  .centro-57357-story,\n  .centro-57357-story * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .centro-57357-story {\n    --c-steel: #015376;\n    --c-blue: #0788bd;\n    --c-sky: #62cbe8;\n    --c-aqua: #b9ecf5;\n    --c-ink: #102a43;\n    --c-text: #344f63;\n    --c-muted: #607989;\n    --c-soft: #eaf7fc;\n    --c-line: rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.13);\n    width: 100%;\n    color: var(--c-text);\n    font-family: \u0022Poppins\u0022, Arial, sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .centro-57357-story a {\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n\n  .centro-57357-story h2,\n  .centro-57357-story h3,\n  .centro-57357-story p {\n    font-family: \u0022Poppins\u0022, Arial, sans-serif !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-kicker {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    color: var(--c-steel) !important;\n    font-size: 11px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-kicker::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    width: 26px;\n    height: 3px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-sky));\n  }\n\n  .c57357-section-title {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-ink) !important;\n    font-size: clamp(25px, 4vw, 36px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n    line-height: 1.16 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-section-copy {\n    margin: 13px 0 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 15px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* INTRODUCTION */\n  .c57357-intro {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 0 0 42px;\n    padding: 38px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);\n    border-radius: 28px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 7%, rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.28), transparent 27%),\n      linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff 0%, #f1faff 100%);\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.10);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    top: -74px;\n    right: -45px;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 190px;\n    border: 35px solid rgba(7, 136, 189, 0.07);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__title {\n    max-width: 610px;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-ink) !important;\n    font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 45px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.045em;\n    line-height: 1.08 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__title span {\n    color: var(--c-blue);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__copy {\n    max-width: 650px;\n    margin: 18px 0 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-text) !important;\n    font-size: 16px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.8 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__tags {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin-top: 25px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__tag {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 7px;\n    padding: 9px 12px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.12);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    color: var(--c-steel);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.80);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.25;\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.06);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-intro__tag::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    width: 7px;\n    height: 7px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--c-blue), var(--c-sky));\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.13);\n  }\n\n  /* SHARED CONTRIBUTION */\n  .c57357-giving {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 42px 0;\n    padding: 34px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);\n    border-radius: 26px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 92% 4%, rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.28), transparent 27%),\n      linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff 0%, #f4fbfe 100%);\n    box-shadow: 0 24px 60px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.10);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-giving::after {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    right: -50px;\n    bottom: -60px;\n    width: 170px;\n    height: 170px;\n    border: 30px solid rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.09);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-giving__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 215px;\n    padding: 20px 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);\n    border-radius: 18px;\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.90);\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.06);\n    transition: transform 260ms ease, box-shadow 260ms ease, border-color 260ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card::after {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    right: -32px;\n    bottom: -34px;\n    width: 88px;\n    height: 88px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: var(--c-soft);\n    transition: transform 300ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card:hover,\n  .c57357-card:focus-within {\n    transform: translateY(-7px);\n    border-color: rgba(7, 136, 189, 0.35);\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.14);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card:hover::after,\n  .c57357-card:focus-within::after {\n    transform: scale(1.28);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card__icon {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 13px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-blue));\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.22);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card__icon svg {\n    display: block;\n    width: 23px;\n    height: 23px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card h3 {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 0 9px !important;\n    color: var(--c-ink) !important;\n    font-size: 17px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.3 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-card p {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.65 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* VIDEO */\n  .c57357-video {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(210px, 0.88fr) minmax(240px, 1.12fr);\n    min-height: 245px;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    background: var(--c-ink);\n    text-decoration: none !important;\n    box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.18);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__copy {\n    display: flex;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 30px;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 100%, rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.20), transparent 34%),\n      linear-gradient(140deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-ink));\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__label {\n    margin: 0 0 9px;\n    color: var(--c-sky);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__copy h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    font-size: 26px !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    line-height: 1.2 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__copy p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78) !important;\n    font-size: 13px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.65 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__cta {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    width: fit-content;\n    margin-top: 18px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__visual {\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 245px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__visual::after {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.34), rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.02));\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__visual img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    min-height: 245px;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    transition: transform 650ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.65, 0.3, 1);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video:hover .c57357-video__visual img,\n  .c57357-video:focus .c57357-video__visual img {\n    transform: scale(1.07);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__play {\n    display: grid;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 2;\n    top: 50%;\n    left: 50%;\n    width: 68px;\n    height: 68px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--c-steel);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);\n    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.28);\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\n    transition: transform 250ms ease, background 250ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__play::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: -9px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);\n    border-radius: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video:hover .c57357-video__play,\n  .c57357-video:focus .c57357-video__play {\n    background: #ffffff;\n    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.08);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-video__play svg {\n    width: 24px;\n    height: 24px;\n    margin-left: 3px;\n  }\n\n  /* COLLECTIVE ACTION PATH */\n  .c57357-path {\n    margin: 48px 0;\n    padding: 6px 0;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-path__steps {\n    display: grid;\n    position: relative;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 18px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-path__steps::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 25px;\n    right: 15%;\n    left: 15%;\n    height: 3px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-sky), var(--c-steel));\n    background-size: 200% 100%;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-step {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-step__number {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 52px;\n    height: 52px;\n    margin: 0 auto 16px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 6px solid #ffffff;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-blue));\n    box-shadow: 0 7px 18px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.24);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-step h3 {\n    margin: 0 0 8px !important;\n    color: var(--c-ink) !important;\n    font-size: 16px !important;\n    font-weight: 650 !important;\n    line-height: 1.35 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-step p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 12.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.65 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* CONTINUING IMPACT */\n  .c57357-impact {\n    display: grid;\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;\n    gap: 22px;\n    margin: 46px 0;\n    padding: 34px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border-radius: 24px;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background:\n      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 12%, rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.30), transparent 30%),\n      linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-ink));\n    box-shadow: 0 22px 50px rgba(16, 42, 67, 0.20);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact::after {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    right: -52px;\n    bottom: -72px;\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 190px;\n    border: 32px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact__icon {\n    display: grid;\n    width: 66px;\n    height: 66px;\n    place-items: center;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);\n    border-radius: 19px;\n    color: var(--c-sky);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact__icon svg {\n    width: 31px;\n    height: 31px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact h2 {\n    margin: 0 0 10px !important;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    font-size: clamp(24px, 4vw, 34px) !important;\n    font-weight: 700 !important;\n    letter-spacing: -0.035em;\n    line-height: 1.18 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.78) !important;\n    font-size: 14px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.75 !important;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact__thanks {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-top: 17px;\n    color: var(--c-aqua);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-impact__thanks::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    width: 22px;\n    height: 2px;\n    border-radius: 99px;\n    background: var(--c-sky);\n  }\n\n  /* 57357 ACCORDION */\n  .c57357-about-hospital {\n    margin: 48px 0;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion {\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 10px;\n    margin-top: 26px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion details {\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);\n    border-radius: 16px;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.06);\n    transition: border-color 240ms ease, box-shadow 240ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion details[open] {\n    border-color: rgba(7, 136, 189, 0.30);\n    box-shadow: 0 14px 30px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.10);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 13px;\n    padding: 18px 20px;\n    color: var(--c-ink);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion summary::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion summary::before {\n    content: \u0022\u0022;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 10px;\n    height: 10px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--c-blue), var(--c-sky));\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(98, 203, 232, 0.13);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion summary::after {\n    content: \u0022\u002B\u0022;\n    display: grid;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    place-items: center;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: var(--c-steel);\n    background: var(--c-soft);\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    line-height: 1;\n    transition: transform 240ms ease, color 240ms ease, background 240ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion details[open] summary::after {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: var(--c-steel);\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion__body {\n    padding: 0 58px 19px 43px;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-accordion__body p {\n    margin: 0 !important;\n    color: var(--c-muted) !important;\n    font-size: 13.5px !important;\n    font-weight: 400 !important;\n    line-height: 1.75 !important;\n  }\n\n  /* ABOUT CENTRO CLOSING */\n  .c57357-centro {\n    position: relative;\n    isolation: isolate;\n    margin: 48px 0 0;\n    padding: 34px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid var(--c-line);\n    border-radius: 25px;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(115deg, rgba(234, 247, 252, 0.96), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.98));\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.09);\n  }\n\n  .c57357-centro::before {\n    content: \u0022CENTRO\u0022;\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: -1;\n    right: -16px;\n    bottom: -24px;\n    color: rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.045);\n    font-size: clamp(70px, 15vw, 126px);\n    font-weight: 800;\n    letter-spacing: -0.06em;\n    line-height: 1;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-centro__services {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 22px 0 0;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-centro__services span {\n    padding: 8px 11px;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.12);\n    border-radius: 999px;\n    color: var(--c-steel);\n    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-centro__button {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 9px;\n    margin-top: 24px;\n    padding: 13px 18px;\n    border-radius: 11px;\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-blue));\n    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.20);\n    font-size: 12px;\n    font-weight: 650;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    transition: transform 220ms ease, box-shadow 220ms ease;\n  }\n\n  .c57357-centro__button:hover,\n  .c57357-centro__button:focus {\n    color: #ffffff !important;\n    transform: translateY(-3px);\n    box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(1, 83, 118, 0.26);\n  }\n\n  /* MOTION */\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n    .c57357-intro,\n    .c57357-giving,\n    .c57357-path,\n    .c57357-impact,\n    .c57357-about-hospital,\n    .c57357-centro {\n      animation: c57357Reveal 680ms both;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-card {\n      animation: c57357Reveal 620ms both;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-card:nth-child(2) {\n      animation-delay: 110ms;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-card:nth-child(3) {\n      animation-delay: 220ms;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-video__play::before {\n      animation: c57357Pulse 2.2s ease-out infinite;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-path__steps::before {\n      animation: c57357Flow 4s linear infinite;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes c57357Reveal {\n    from {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: translateY(16px);\n    }\n    to {\n      opacity: 1;\n      transform: translateY(0);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes c57357Pulse {\n    0% {\n      opacity: 0.75;\n      transform: scale(0.92);\n    }\n    75%,\n    100% {\n      opacity: 0;\n      transform: scale(1.35);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @keyframes c57357Flow {\n    to {\n      background-position: -200% 0;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 760px) {\n    .c57357-intro,\n    .c57357-giving,\n    .c57357-impact,\n    .c57357-centro {\n      padding: 25px 20px;\n      border-radius: 21px;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-giving__grid,\n    .c57357-path__steps,\n    .c57357-video {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-card {\n      min-height: auto;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-video__visual {\n      min-height: 220px;\n      order: -1;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-video__visual img {\n      min-height: 220px;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-path__steps {\n      gap: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-path__steps::before {\n      top: 24px;\n      bottom: 24px;\n      left: 25px;\n      width: 3px;\n      height: auto;\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--c-steel), var(--c-sky), var(--c-steel));\n      background-size: 100% 200%;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-step {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 52px 1fr;\n      column-gap: 16px;\n      text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-step__number {\n      grid-row: 1 / span 2;\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-impact {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-impact__icon {\n      width: 56px;\n      height: 56px;\n    }\n\n    .c57357-accordion__body {\n      padding-right: 20px;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n    }\n  }\n\u003C/style\u003E\n\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022centro-57357-story\u0022\u003E\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-intro\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-intro-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-kicker\u0022\u003EWorld Humanitarian Day\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ch2 class=\u0022c57357-intro__title\u0022 id=\u0022c57357-intro-title\u0022\u003E\n      When Compassion Becomes \u003Cspan\u003ECollective Action\u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-intro__copy\u0022\u003E\n      World Humanitarian Day is an opportunity to recognize the power of compassion, shared responsibility, and support for organizations creating lasting impact within their communities.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-intro__copy\u0022\u003E\n      Centro marked the occasion with a visit to Children\u2019s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357, bringing our people together in support of one of Egypt\u2019s most recognized community-powered healthcare institutions.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-intro__tags\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Article highlights\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-intro__tag\u0022\u003EHospital 57357\u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-intro__tag\u0022\u003ECommunity Support\u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-intro__tag\u0022\u003ECentroees Giving Together\u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-giving\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-giving-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-kicker\u0022\u003EGiving in Action\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ch2 class=\u0022c57357-section-title\u0022 id=\u0022c57357-giving-title\u0022\u003EA Shared Contribution from Centro and Our Centroees\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-section-copy\u0022\u003E\n      The initiative brought together Centro\u2019s corporate support and the generosity of our Centroees, creating one collective contribution in support of Hospital 57357.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-giving__grid\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-card\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-card__icon\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Csvg viewBox=\u00220 0 24 24\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M4 10.5h16v9H4z\u0022 /\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M3 10.5 12 4l9 6.5M8 19.5v-5h8v5\u0022 /\u003E\n          \u003C/svg\u003E\n        \u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003ECorporate Support\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003ECentro made a corporate donation in support of the hospital\u2019s ongoing mission and the communities it serves.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-card\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-card__icon\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Csvg viewBox=\u00220 0 24 24\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M12 20.5S4.5 16.2 4.5 9.8A4.3 4.3 0 0 1 12 6.9a4.3 4.3 0 0 1 7.5 2.9C19.5 16.2 12 20.5 12 20.5Z\u0022 /\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M12 6.9V3.5M9.5 4.8 12 3.5l2.5 1.3\u0022 /\u003E\n          \u003C/svg\u003E\n        \u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003ECentroee Contributions\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003EPersonal donations from our people became part of Centro\u2019s accumulated contribution to Hospital 57357.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-card\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-card__icon\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Csvg viewBox=\u00220 0 24 24\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M5 9h14v11H5zM3.5 9h17\u0022 /\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M12 9v11M7.5 6.5C7.5 4.6 9.7 4 12 9c2.3-5 4.5-4.4 4.5-2.5 0 1.5-1.5 2.5-4.5 2.5-3 0-4.5-1-4.5-2.5Z\u0022 /\u003E\n          \u003C/svg\u003E\n        \u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003EMoments of Encouragement\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003EOur team brought toys for the children, adding a thoughtful and personal gesture to the visit.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n\n    \u003Ca class=\u0022c57357-video\u0022 href=\u0022https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7497632157146996736\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener noreferrer\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Watch Centro\u2019s visit to Children\u2019s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357 on LinkedIn\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-video__copy\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-video__label\u0022\u003ECentro at Hospital 57357\u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003EWatch the Visit\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003ESee the moments that brought our Centroees together in support of Hospital 57357.\u003C/p\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-video__cta\u0022\u003E\n          Watch on LinkedIn\n          \u003Csvg aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022 viewBox=\u00220 0 20 20\u0022 width=\u002217\u0022 height=\u002217\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4\u0022 /\u003E\n          \u003C/svg\u003E\n        \u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-video__visual\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cimg decoding=\u0022async\u0022 src=\u0022https://centrocdx.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/57-BLOG-3.png\u0022 alt=\u0022\u0022 loading=\u0022lazy\u0022 /\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-video__play\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Csvg viewBox=\u00220 0 24 24\u0022 fill=\u0022currentColor\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n            \u003Cpath d=\u0022M8.2 5.8v12.4L18 12 8.2 5.8Z\u0022 /\u003E\n          \u003C/svg\u003E\n        \u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003C/a\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-path\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-path-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-kicker\u0022\u003EThe Importance of Collective Action\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ch2 class=\u0022c57357-section-title\u0022 id=\u0022c57357-path-title\u0022\u003EImpact Grows When People Participate Together\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-section-copy\u0022\u003E\n      Hospital 57357 reflects what can be achieved when individuals, organizations, and communities come together around a shared purpose. Corporate contributions, employee participation, and greater awareness can each strengthen that effort.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-path__steps\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-step\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-step__number\u0022\u003E01\u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003EBuild Awareness\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003EBring attention to organizations creating meaningful community impact.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-step\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-step__number\u0022\u003E02\u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003EEncourage Participation\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003ECreate opportunities for people and businesses to contribute together.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n      \u003Carticle class=\u0022c57357-step\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-step__number\u0022\u003E03\u003C/span\u003E\n        \u003Ch3\u003ESustain Support\u003C/h3\u003E\n        \u003Cp\u003ETurn individual actions into a wider and more lasting collective effort.\u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003C/article\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-impact\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-impact-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-impact__icon\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Csvg viewBox=\u00220 0 24 24\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cpath d=\u0022M12 21S4 16.5 4 9.7A4.5 4.5 0 0 1 12 6.9a4.5 4.5 0 0 1 8 2.8C20 16.5 12 21 12 21Z\u0022 /\u003E\n        \u003Cpath d=\u0022M9 12h6M12 9v6\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003C/svg\u003E\n    \u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv\u003E\n      \u003Ch2 id=\u0022c57357-impact-title\u0022\u003EContinuing to Make an Impact\u003C/h2\u003E\n      \u003Cp\u003E\n        Meaningful change is rarely created by one contribution alone. It becomes stronger when individuals, businesses, and communities choose to participate together. Centro remains committed to supporting initiatives that create value for the communities around us and encourage our people to take part in making a positive difference.\n      \u003C/p\u003E\n      \u003Cspan class=\u0022c57357-impact__thanks\u0022\u003EThank you to every Centroee who contributed\u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-about-hospital\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-hospital-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-kicker\u0022\u003EAbout Hospital 57357\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ch2 class=\u0022c57357-section-title\u0022 id=\u0022c57357-hospital-title\u0022\u003EA Community-Powered Mission\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-section-copy\u0022\u003E\n      Children\u2019s Cancer Hospital Egypt 57357 was established in 2007 with a mission focused on combating childhood cancer through quality care, research, and education while providing treatment to children free of charge.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-accordion\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cdetails open\u003E\n        \u003Csummary\u003EBuilt Through Community Support\u003C/summary\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-accordion__body\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Cp\u003EThe hospital was built through donations, demonstrating the impact individuals, organizations, and communities can create when they come together behind a shared purpose.\u003C/p\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n      \u003C/details\u003E\n      \u003Cdetails\u003E\n        \u003Csummary\u003ESpecialized Pediatric Oncology Care\u003C/summary\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-accordion__body\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Cp\u003EHospital 57357 provides specialized care for children while working to ensure that access to treatment is not determined by a family\u2019s financial circumstances.\u003C/p\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n      \u003C/details\u003E\n      \u003Cdetails\u003E\n        \u003Csummary\u003EResearch and Education\u003C/summary\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-accordion__body\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Cp\u003EResearch and education form an important part of the hospital\u2019s mission, supporting the continued development of knowledge and care in pediatric oncology.\u003C/p\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n      \u003C/details\u003E\n      \u003Cdetails\u003E\n        \u003Csummary\u003ESupport Beyond Treatment\u003C/summary\u003E\n        \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-accordion__body\u0022\u003E\n          \u003Cp\u003EThe hospital\u2019s approach also includes rehabilitation, psychological support, social support, and services designed to help children and their families throughout the care journey.\u003C/p\u003E\n        \u003C/div\u003E\n      \u003C/details\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\n  \u003Csection class=\u0022c57357-centro\u0022 aria-labelledby=\u0022c57357-centro-title\u0022\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-kicker\u0022\u003EAbout Centro\u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Ch2 class=\u0022c57357-section-title\u0022 id=\u0022c57357-centro-title\u0022\u003EPeople, Performance, and Meaningful Impact\u003C/h2\u003E\n    \u003Cp class=\u0022c57357-section-copy\u0022\u003E\n      Centro is a global BPO and technology services provider supporting organizations through Contact Center Outsourcing, healthcare operations, and digital transformation. Across our global delivery network, we combine operational expertise with a people-first culture that encourages professional growth, community engagement, and real-world results.\n    \u003C/p\u003E\n    \u003Cdiv class=\u0022c57357-centro__services\u0022 aria-label=\u0022Centro areas of expertise\u0022\u003E\n      \u003Cspan\u003EContact Center Outsourcing\u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003Cspan\u003EHealthcare Operations\u003C/span\u003E\n      \u003Cspan\u003EDigital Transformation\u003C/span\u003E\n    \u003C/div\u003E\n    \u003Ca class=\u0022c57357-centro__button\u0022 href=\u0022https://centrocdx.com/about\u0022\u003E\n      Learn More About Centro\n      \u003Csvg aria-hidden=\u0022true\u0022 viewBox=\u00220 0 20 20\u0022 width=\u002217\u0022 height=\u002217\u0022 fill=\u0022none\u0022 stroke=\u0022currentColor\u0022 stroke-width=\u00221.8\u0022 stroke-linecap=\u0022round\u0022 stroke-linejoin=\u0022round\u0022\u003E\n        \u003Cpath d=\u0022M4 10h11M11 6l4 4-4 4\u0022 /\u003E\n      \u003C/svg\u003E\n    \u003C/a\u003E\n  \u003C/section\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
